==Battleground==
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage includes quite a few Angel and Zombie enemies, so it's not ideal to just jump in and try to rush the stage. Bringing [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], and [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] will greatly help out here.

